From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nmcu2780 <203441210+nmcu2780@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:44:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/19] i18n: translate session-manager plugin

Wrap all user-visible strings via zellij-i18n tr/trf/tr_ctx: welcome and
session-list screens, exited/resurrect sessions, new-session form (layout
selection, folder prompt), rename and kill confirmations, help/hint lines,
errors, inbox, app panel, badges and time-ago strings. Layout prompt color
ranges and row-span lengths are computed from the translated text; centering
and fit checks use display_width instead of chars().count()/len().
---
